cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use HEPToolBench, please cite this software and the associated paper."
title: "HEPToolBench"
type: software
version: "1.2"
date-released: 2026-08-12
authors:
  - family-names: "Singh"
    given-names: "Aadarsh"
    affiliation: "Indian Institute of Science"
abstract: >-
  HEPToolBench is a deterministic benchmark for evaluating language models
  on high-energy-physics software workflows. Version 1.2 contains 31 tasks,
  artifact-based validators and scorers, model runners, curated results,
  and reproducibility metadata.
keywords:
  - high-energy physics
  - large language models
  - benchmark
  - scientific software
  - reproducibility
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/AadarshSingh0/HEPToolBench"
